OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786385905
OL,3,COnline sex offender preyed on girls
OL,4,Cacross the world 'like shark'
OL,6,FAn online predator from Leeds who
OL,7,Fforced more than 100 people into sex
OL,8,Facts and self harm, making victims
OL,9,Fcarve his username into their bodies,
OL,10,Fhas been jailed.
OL,12,FJustin Swaddle used platforms such as
OL,13,FSnapchat, Telegram and Discord to
OL,14,F"prey" on victims from across the
OL,15,Fworld "like a shark", a sentencing
OL,16,Fjudge said on Monday.
OL,18,FHe was 17 when he preyed upon people
OL,19,Fhe met online under myriad usernames,
OL,20,Fincluding 'Epstein', 'Rugen' and
OL,21,F'Moscow'.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
