FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786385905
OL,3,COnline sex offender preyed on girls
OL,4,Cacross the world 'like shark'
OL,6,FNow aged 20, Swaddle - from Meanwood
OL,7,Fin Leeds - has been jailed for two
OL,8,Fyears after detectives at the National
OL,9,FCrime Agency discovered hundreds of
OL,10,Fconversations with girls of a sexual
OL,11,Fnature on his phone and computer.
OL,13,FInvestigators found Swaddle had been
OL,14,Foperating in a Com group - an online
OL,15,Fcommunity using messaging apps and
OL,16,Fgaming platforms for carrying out
OL,17,Fcrimes such as targeting young girls
OL,18,Ffor sexual reasons.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786385905
OL,3,COnline sex offender preyed on girls
OL,4,Cacross the world 'like shark'
OL,6,FAccording to the NCA, motives for Com
OL,7,Fgroups are more to do with the power
OL,8,Fand notoriety which comes with sharing
OL,9,Fshocking content with other members,
OL,10,Frather than money or sexual
OL,11,Fgratification.
OL,13,FSome 117 victims aged between 13 and
OL,14,F17 were able to be identified - eight
OL,15,Fof whom were in the UK.
OL,17,FOne of Swaddle's victims told police
OL,18,Fhow he had asked her to send nude
OL,19,Fphotographs of herself and to carve
OL,20,Fhis name into her body.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786385905
OL,3,COnline sex offender preyed on girls
OL,4,Cacross the world 'like shark'
OL,6,FThe girl had complied with Swaddle's
OL,7,Frequests after her threatened her,
OL,8,Ftelling her he had her personal
OL,9,Fdetails and knew where she went to
OL,10,Fschool.
OL,12,FAn examination of Swaddle's messages
OL,13,Fon the encrypted chat app Telegram
OL,14,Falso found he had attempted to incite
OL,15,Fa child into sexually abusing a
OL,16,Fyounger child and record it,
OL,17,Fthreatening to leak indecent images if
OL,18,Fthey didn't comply with his request.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786385905
OL,3,COnline sex offender preyed on girls
OL,4,Cacross the world 'like shark'
OL,6,FSwaddle was ultimately charged with
OL,7,Fand pleaded guilty to eight sexual
OL,8,Foffences, including three of inciting
OL,9,Fa child into engaging in a sexual
OL,10,Factivity, as well as a count of
OL,11,Fblackmail.
OL,13,FHe was sentenced to two years at Leeds
OL,14,FCrown Court on Monday. His Honour
OL,15,FJudge Peter Kelson KC described it as
OL,16,Fone of the most extreme cases he had
OL,17,Fever seen and branded him a "predatory
OL,18,Fshark preying on children swimming in
OL,19,Fthe dark waters of the internet".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786385905
OL,3,COnline sex offender preyed on girls
OL,4,Cacross the world 'like shark'
OL,6,FSwaddle was also made subject of a 10-
OL,7,Fyear Sexual Harm Prevention Order and
OL,8,Fmade to sign the Sex Offenders
OL,9,FRegister.
OL,11,FDanielle Pownall, Operations Manager
OL,12,Ffrom the NCA, said: "Justin Swaddle
OL,13,Ftargeted young and vulnerable victims
OL,14,Fall over the world to abuse and scare
OL,15,Fthem into carrying out shocking self-
OL,16,Fharm and sexual activity, purely to
OL,17,Fgain popularity with his peers online.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786385905
OL,3,COnline sex offender preyed on girls
OL,4,Cacross the world 'like shark'
OL,6,F"He gained the trust of his victims,
OL,7,Fbefore collecting private information
OL,8,Fabout them so he could threaten to
OL,9,Fshare their intimate images or report
OL,10,Fthem to their school or parents to
OL,11,Fincite further content.
OL,13,F"While the number of people involved
OL,14,Fin Com groups are relatively small,
OL,15,Fthe impact it has on victims is high
OL,16,Fand long-lasting, as Swaddle's
OL,17,Foffending shows."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/7
